      </nav>
      <h1>About {{ site.name }}</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Licensed general contractor. {{ site.areaServed }} area. In business since {{ site.founded }}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-split">
        <div class="about-photo-col">
          <div class="about-photo-rect">
            <span style="font-size:3rem;" aria-hidden="true">🏠</span>
            <p>Your team photo goes here</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">Our Story</span>
          <h2>Built on Craftsmanship, Not Shortcuts</h2>
          <div class="section-rule" style="margin:12px 0 24px;"></div>
          <p>We started {{ site.name }} in {{ site.founded }} because we kept seeing the same problem: homeowners getting beautiful estimates from contractors who couldn't follow through. Tile laid with lippage. Grout that cracked in six months. Projects that ran three weeks over and $10,000 over budget.</p>
          <p>We do it differently. Every project gets a written schedule and a written estimate before we start. Every change gets approved by you before it happens. And we pull permits on every job — because your home is an investment, and the paperwork protects that investment when you sell.</p>
          <p>In {{ site.yearsExp }} years, we've built most of our business on referrals. That tells us everything we need to know about whether we're doing this right.</p>
          <div class="about-stats">
            <div class="about-stat"><strong>{{ site.yearsExp }}+</strong><span>Years in Business</span></div>
            <div class="about-stat"><strong>500+</strong><span>Projects Completed</span></div>
            <div class="about-stat"><strong>100%</strong><span>Permitted Work</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="cred-chips">
            <div class="cred-chip">Licensed General Contractor</div>
            <div class="cred-chip">Fully Insured</div>
            <div class="cred-chip">{{ site.yearsExp }}+ Years Experience</div>
            <div class="cred-chip">All Work Permitted</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

